---
title: SEQ-04 — Classes, enrolment and Teacher access (UC-17, UC-18, UC-26, UC-27)
config:
  theme: neutral
---
sequenceDiagram
    actor Teacher as Teacher
    actor Reader as Quran Reader
    participant App as Itqan App
    participant Class as Class Service
    participant Account as Account Service
    participant DB as Database
    alt UC-17 Create or rename Class
        Teacher->>App: Enter Class name
        alt Name empty
            App-->>Teacher: Refuse change
        else Create new Class
            App->>Class: createOrRenameClass(create, name)
            Class->>DB: Store Teacher-owned Class with unique join code
            Class-->>App: Class and permanent code
            App-->>Teacher: Show code to share outside app
        else Rename owned Class
            App->>Class: createOrRenameClass(rename, Class, name)
            Class->>DB: Check ownership, update name only
            Class-->>App: Renamed Class with unchanged code
        end
        Note over Class,DB: Names may repeat, no Class status or single-Class deletion
    else UC-26 Join Class via code
        Reader->>App: Enter join code
        App->>Class: Find Class and check active membership
        Class->>DB: Read Class, Teacher name and active Enrolment
        alt Code invalid or Class erased
            Class-->>App: Code not found
            App-->>Reader: No Enrolment created
        else Already actively enrolled
            Class-->>App: Already in this Class
            App-->>Reader: No new Enrolment
        else Valid code and no active Enrolment
            Class-->>App: Class and Teacher display name
            App-->>Reader: Ask for teacher-sharing consent
            alt Reader declines
                App-->>Reader: Do not join
            else Reader grants or already has active grant
                App->>Account: grantOrWithdrawConsent if no active grant
                Account->>DB: Record new dated grant only when needed
                App->>Class: joinOrLeaveClass(join, Reader, Class)
                Class->>DB: Recheck code and consent, insert active Enrolment
                Note over DB: One active row per Reader/Class, rejoin gets new date
                Class-->>App: Joined with new join date
                App-->>Reader: Show Class in My Classes
            end
        end
        Note over Reader,DB: Reader may join several Classes
    else UC-27 Leave Class
        Reader->>App: Open My Classes and choose Leave
        App->>Class: List active Classes
        Class->>DB: Read active Enrolments
        alt No active Classes
            App-->>Reader: Empty state
        else Class selected
            App-->>Reader: Ask for confirmation
            alt Reader cancels
                App-->>Reader: Nothing changes
            else Reader confirms
                App->>Class: joinOrLeaveClass(leave, Reader, Class)
                Class->>DB: Set leftAt and end reason left
                App-->>Reader: Leave confirmed
                Note over DB: Teacher access stops, delivered Messages remain
            end
        end
    else UC-18 Teacher dashboard
        Teacher->>App: Open dashboard
        App->>Class: Get Teacher's Classes
        Class->>DB: Read owned Classes
        alt No Classes
            App-->>Teacher: Prompt Create Class
        else Class selected
            Teacher->>App: Select Class
            App->>Class: Get Class dashboard
            Class->>DB: Verify ownership and active Readers
            alt No active Readers
                App-->>Teacher: Show join code
            else Active Readers
                Class->>DB: Derive activity, full mastery and average from visible Sessions
                Note over Class: Activity includes Session count and last practice date
                Note over DB: Earliest active join date across this Teacher's Classes
                Class-->>App: Class view with filtered Reader summaries
                Teacher->>App: Select Reader
                App->>Class: getVisibleSessions(Teacher, Class, Reader)
                Class->>DB: Recheck ownership and active Enrolment
                alt Reader left or withdrew consent
                    Class-->>App: Access denied
                    App-->>Teacher: Return to Class view
                else Access valid
                    Class->>DB: Read Sessions ended on or after earliest active join date
                    alt No visible Sessions
                        App-->>Teacher: Empty Session list
                    else Sessions exist
                        Class-->>App: Surah, date, mode and score per Session
                        Teacher->>App: Select Session
                        App->>Class: getVisibleSessions(Teacher, Class, Reader, Session)
                        Class->>DB: Recheck active access and Session date
                        alt Access changed
                            App-->>Teacher: Do not show Session
                        else Access valid
                            Class->>DB: Read Mistakes with Word and Tajweed Rule
                            App-->>Teacher: Show Word, error type and Rule, never audio
                        end
                    end
                end
            end
        end
    end
    Note over Teacher,Class: Teachers cannot add or remove Readers
